<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's Cemig as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's Cemig as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said it was initiating coverage of Minas Gerais state power utility Cemig with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- It said it expected Cemig to report 1996 net income of 2.20 reais per 1,000 shares, representing a 22 percent increase over the previous year.</p>
</text>
